Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:05.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Hear your quest progress
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:05.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Worker voice lines and optional quality-of-life tweaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:12.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Objective complete
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:12.42,Body,,0,0,0,,The Alliance worker responds: “More work?”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:19.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Quest ready to turn in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:19.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Finish the whole quest: “Job’s done!”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:24.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Choose your worker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:24.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Horde Peon or Alliance worker — your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:31.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Quest progress and range
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:31.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Objective counts and distance, right above your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:37.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Progress in color
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:37.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Quest progress changes from red through yellow to green.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:45.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,“Work complete.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:45.42,Body,,0,0,0,,The Horde Peon announces a completed quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:53.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Automatic quest tracking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:53.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Newly accepted quests appear in the objective tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:59.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Item level and movement speed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:59.42,Body,,0,0,0,,See both values directly on your player frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:05.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,XP and reputation at a glance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:05.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Colored numbers, reputation remaining and your standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.62,0:01:11.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Who is targeting whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.62,0:01:11.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Unit tooltips show their target. Here: you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:15.92,Heading,,0,0,0,,Before: completed achievements
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:15.92,Body,,0,0,0,,The default view includes achievements you already earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:20.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,After: focus on what is missing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:20.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Hide completed achievements when you open the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:26.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Find your cursor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:26.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Shake the mouse to highlight your cursor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:32.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Your adventure. Your settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:32.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Toggle each feature separately. Open settings with /sqol config.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:39.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,Free for Retail and WoW Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:39.42,Body,,0,0,0,,Find “SMoRGs QoL” on your preferred addon platform.
